{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"restclient","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"HTTP requests","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for HTTP requests (.http .rest).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"restclient","name":"HTTP requests","extensions":[".http",".rest"],"grammar":"grammars/restclient.json","lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"HTTP requests","path":"snippets/restclient.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/restclient.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^###.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9-]*(?=:)\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\{\\\\{[^}]+\\\\}\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"https?://[^\\\\s]+\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^@[A-Za-z_]+(?=\\\\s*=)\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:OPTIONS|CONNECT|DELETE|PATCH|TRACE|POST|HEAD|HTTP|GET|PUT)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/restclient.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"GET\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"get\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"GET ${1:https://example.com/api} HTTP/1.1\",\n      \"Accept: application/json\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A GET request\"\n  },\n  \"POST JSON\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"post\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"POST ${1:https://example.com/api} HTTP/1.1\",\n      \"Content-Type: application/json\",\n      \"\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"\\t\\\"${2:key}\\\": \\\"${3:value}\\\"\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A POST with JSON\"\n  },\n  \"Bearer auth\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"auth\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Authorization: Bearer ${1:token}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An Authorization header\"\n  },\n  \"Separator\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sep\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"###\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Separate requests\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# HTTP requests\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for HTTP requests.\n\n## Files\n\n`.http`, `.rest`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `get` | A GET request |\n| `post` | A POST with JSON |\n| `auth` | An Authorization header |\n| `sep` | Separate requests |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}